    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Spearpoint Task Force",
    "summary": "You may take one extra Assault or Tactical Doctrine selection per battle. Add 1 to Advance rolls for friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES MOUNTED or ADEPTUS ASTARTES SPEEDER units. Once the battle’s first Fight phase closes, friendly units with SUBODEN KHAN can invoke Wrath of the First Khan if they were eligible to fight. If unengaged, the unit may then take a Normal Move. An engaged one can Fall Back. WHITE SCARS are allowed, with other chapter-specific ADEPTUS ASTARTES excluded.",
